### Get All Categories (Paginated with Search)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&name=
Accept: application/json

### Get All Categories - Page 2
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories?pageNumber=2&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Search Categories by Name
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&name=Beverages
Accept: application/json

### Get Category by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories/{id}
Accept: application/json

### Create Category
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Beverages",
  "description": "Hot and cold drinks"
}

### Create Category - Another Example
POST http://localhost:5000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Desserts",
  "description": "Sweet treats and pastries"
}

### Update Category
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/categories/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Beverages",
  "description": "Updated description - Hot, cold, and specialty drinks"
}

### Delete Category (Soft Delete)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/categories/{id}
Accept: application/json
